   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "Many members of the TENNET community have reached out to us requesting for a metal bracelet option. We are happy to oblige. After many rounds of research, we have created this beautiful three-link 316L stainless steel bracelet, with alternating finishing of high polish and vertical brush. The bracelet also tapers subtly around your wrist, and ends with a buckle that has twin actuators for security and assurance. That's not all. To ensure your wearing comfort, the buckle also comes equipped with on-the-fly adjustability for a more precise fit. We are very pleased with the quality and fit of our bracelet. They give the Somerset range of our watches a sportier and more dynamic look. See the results for yourself. We hope that you like our new creation as much as we enjoyed creating it.",
